              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour, large shield and heavy throwing spear. Seasoned Legionaries are Drilled. Seasoned and Elite Legionaries may be Veteran (+1). Legionary units are led by a Centurion who costs 10 points rather than the usual 5-point leader cost. The Centurion increases the Ld of the unit by 1. He counts as a normal leader in every other respect.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
